{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1791657687075,"sessionID":"ses_ed8e74236ffe5avP2OYno0XijV","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"bash","callID":"call_00_YLc9ItZOLfquAGqkFsYX3798","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"rg -n --no-config -S \"agent-improvement|deep-improvement|deep:agent\" .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/mode-registry.json .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/hub-router.json .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/ROUTER.md .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/SKILL.md .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/command-metadata.json .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/leaf-manifest.json .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/leaf-scopes.json .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/graph-metadata.json 2>/dev/null | head -100"},"output":".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/leaf-scopes.json:3:    \"workflowMode\": \"agent-improvement\",\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/leaf-scopes.json:5:      \"assets/agent-improvement\",\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/leaf-scopes.json:6:      \"references/agent-improvement\",\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/mode-registry.json:9:    \"backendKind\": \"Which backend actually runs the mode: runtime-loop-type (runtime/ convergence) or improvement-host (deep-improvement/scripts/shared/loop-host.cjs --mode).\"\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/mode-registry.json:14:    \"advisorDefaultMode\": \"Marks the default mode a multi-mode legacy id folds to (deep-improvement -> agent-improvement). Never inferred from array order.\",\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/mode-registry.json:16:    \"packetSkillName\": \"The packet's SKILL.md name. Most packets use folder == packetSkillName == deep-<mode> (e.g. deep-ai-council). Exception: the two improvement lanes (agent/model) multiplex onto one shared packet 'deep-improvement', so several workflowModes map to that single folder/packetSkillName. The legacy public key 'ai-council' is preserved only on the command/agent surfaces, not on the packet folder/name.\",\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/mode-registry.json:104:      \"workflowMode\": \"agent-improvement\",\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/mode-registry.json:115:      \"packet\": \"deep-improvement\",\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/mode-registry.json:116:      \"packetSkillName\": \"deep-improvement\",\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/mode-registry.json:117:      \"loopHostMode\": \"agent-improvement\",\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/mode-registry.json:118:      \"command\": \"/deep:agent-improvement\",\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/mode-registry.json:119:      \"agent\": \"deep-improvement\",\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/mode-registry.json:121:      \"aliases\": [\"improve agent\", \"evaluate agent\", \"agent scoring\", \"score agent candidate\", \"promote or rollback agent change\", \"agent-improvement\"],\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/mode-registry.json:124:        \"legacyAdvisorId\": \"deep-improvement\",\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/mode-registry.json:126:        \"legacyAliases\": [\"command-spec-kit-deep-agent-improvement\", \"/deep:agent-improvement\", \"deep-agent-improvement\", \"sk-deep-agent-improvement\"]\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/mode-registry.json:141:      \"packet\": \"deep-improvement\",\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/mode-registry.json:142:      \"packetSkillName\": \"deep-improvement\",\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/mode-registry.json:145:      \"agent\": \"deep-improvement\",\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/graph-metadata.json:43:    \"agent-improvement\",\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/graph-metadata.json:54:    \"deep-improvement\",\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/graph-metadata.json:110:      \"deep-improvement\",\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/graph-metadata.json:111:      \"agent-improvement\",\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/graph-metadata.json:124:      \"agent-improvement\",\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/graph-metadata.json:134:      \".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-improvement/SKILL.md\",\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/graph-metadata.json:158:    \"causal_summary\": \"system-deep-loop is the single public skill that merges active deep-loop persona modes (deep-research, deep-review, deep-ai-council, deep-improvement) into one advisor identity with active mode packets, routed by workflowMode through mode-registry.json over a nested runtime/ infrastructure layer (frozen, MCP-free; formerly the separate deep-loop-runtime skill, merged 2026-07-08). @context owns one-shot retrieval while research and review carry bounded context snapshots. Per-mode convergence, state, artifacts, and tool-permission contracts are preserved unflattened; the three-tier discriminator (workflowMode / runtimeLoopType / backendKind)keeps graph-backed modes and improvement-host modes distinct. The prior deep-loop-workflows <-> deep-loop-runtime inter-skill relationship is now intra-skill structure; runtime/ has no graph-metadata.json of its own and is not independently advisor-routable.\",\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/graph-metadata.json:166:      \"deep-improvement/SKILL.md\",\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/SKILL.md:8:<!-- Keywords: system-deep-loop, deep-loop, deep-research, deep-review, deep-ai-council, deep-improvement, autoresearch, iterative-research, review-loop, deep-review-wave, release-readiness, severity-findings, P0-P1-P2, ai-council, council-deliberation, multi-seat-planning, agent-improvement, benchmark-harness, model-benchmark, convergence-detection, externalized-state, iteration-files, coverage-graph, mode-registry, workflowmode, runtimeloop-type, backendkind -->\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/SKILL.md:29:| **improvement** (2 lanes) | Evaluator-first improvement: `agent-improvement`, `model-benchmark` | `system-deep-loop/deep-improvement/` | `/deep:agent-improvement` · `/deep:model-benchmark` | `deep-improvement` |\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/SKILL.md:49:Stage 2 of routing lives in `ROUTER.md` at the hub root, next to `SKILL.md` and `README.md`. It defines the per-mode leaf-intent model (the research loop protocol/state/convergence leaves, the review loop protocol/completion/convergence leaves, the ai-council loop protocol/scoring/output-schema leaves, the agent-improvement candidate/score/promotion-gate leaves, and the model-benchmark evaluator leaves), the machine-readable `DEFAULT_RESOURCE` / `INTENT_SIGNALS` / `RESOURCE_MAP` block that the deterministic router-replay and benchmarks parse, and the how-to-read rules (dominant intent → one leaf set; near-tied intents → deduped union; no keyword match → hub `defer`, never a silent default to a mode). Every `RESOURCE_MAP` path is packet-qualified and converts to the canonical `(workflowMode, leafResourceId)` pair at the one contract boundary.\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/SKILL.md:60:- **`workflowMode`** — the public active mode key: `research`, `review`, `ai-council`, and the two improvement lanes `agent-improvement` and `model-benchmark`.\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/SKILL.md:62:- **`backendKind`** — which backend runs the mode: `runtime-loop-type` (research/review/ai-council) or `improvement-host` (`deep-improvement/scripts/shared/loop-host.cjs --mode`).\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/SKILL.md:67:    \"Confirm whether this is research, review, ai-council, or one improvement lane (agent-improvement, model-benchmark) work\",\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/SKILL.md:82:       (the 3 improvement modes all share the system-deep-loop/deep-improvement/ packet)\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/SKILL.md:104:  deep-research/   deep-review/   deep-ai-council/   deep-improvement/   # active mode packets\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/SKILL.md:122:- **ALWAYS** keep the root `ROUTER.md` `RESOURCE_MAP` in sync with `leaf-manifest.json` — the leaf sets dual-read to canonical typed pairs at the one contract boundary; the three improvement lanes stay distinct `(workflowMode, leafResourceId)` pairs even though they share the `deep-improvement` packet.\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/SKILL.md:141:- 