{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1791657755928,"sessionID":"ses_ed8e74236ffe5avP2OYno0XijV","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"bash","callID":"call_01_f8rlAU5eGOAr9J3y2CNR9235","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"rg -n \"agent-improvement|deep-improvement\" .skilled/commands/deep/assets/compiled/README.md .skilled/commands/deep/assets/legacy/README.md; echo \"===LEAF-SCOPES===\"; cat .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/leaf-scopes.json; echo \"===HUB-ROUTER===\"; cat .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/hub-router.json"},"output":".skilled/commands/deep/assets/legacy/README.md:23:Each body has a matching compiled contract in `../compiled/`. There is no fifth body and no unmatched body-to-contract relationship in this directory. The remaining rollout entries, `deep/agent-improvement` and `deep/model-benchmark`, are intentionally fallback-only command files outside this asset inventory and have not been compiled.\n.skilled/commands/deep/assets/compiled/README.md:23:The compiled inventory is intentionally limited to the three commands registered with the contract compiler and renderer: `deep/ai-council`, `deep/research` and `deep/review`. Each has one matching legacy body in `../legacy/`; no legacy body in that directory lacks a compiled counterpart. The rollout entries for `deep/agent-improvement` and `deep/model-benchmark` are fallback-only and are not compiler-managed asset pairs.\n===LEAF-SCOPES===\n[\n  {\n    \"workflowMode\": \"agent-improvement\",\n    \"leafScopes\": [\n      \"assets/agent-improvement\",\n      \"references/agent-improvement\",\n      \"references/shared\"\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"workflowMode\": \"model-benchmark\",\n    \"leafScopes\": [\n      \"assets/model-benchmark\",\n      \"references/model-benchmark\",\n      \"references/shared\"\n    ]\n  }\n]\n===HUB-ROUTER===\n{\n  \"skill\": \"system-deep-loop\",\n  \"version\": \"1.5.3.0\",\n  \"routerPolicy\": {\n    \"defaultMode\": null,\n    \"ambiguityDelta\": 1,\n    \"tieBreak\": [\"research\", \"review\", \"ai-council\", \"agent-improvement\", \"model-benchmark\"],\n    \"outcomes\": {\n      \"single\": \"one dominant deep-loop intent routes to one mode\",\n      \"orderedBundle\": \"clearly separate deep-loop intents route to an ordered mode list\",\n      \"defer\": \"unclear or contradictory deep-loop intent asks for disambiguation\"\n    },\n    \"defaultResource\": [\"ROUTER.md\", \"mode-registry.json\"],\n    \"defaultResourceSemantics\": \"fallback-only\",\n    \"defaultResourceContract\": \"A scored route assembles exactly the selected mode's declared resources. defaultResource is consulted only when no mode scores (zero-signal branch), and then only as the defer-time suggestion offered with the disambiguation checklist. It is never a stage-two preamble loaded on every route, and never unioned into a scored route's resource set.\",\n    \"launcherVocabularyClasses\": [],\n    \"discoveryClasses\": [\"hub-identity\"],\n    \"discoveryClassesContract\": \"Classes listed here are hub discovery/defer evidence only. They are intentionally referenced by NO mode's scoring classes: a prompt naming only the hub (including its former identity) scores zero modes and takes the defer outcome instead of guessing a loop.\"\n  },\n  \"routerSignals\": {\n    \"research\": {\n      \"weight\": 4,\n      \"classes\": [\"research-aliases\"],\n      \"resources\": [\"deep-research/SKILL.md\"]\n    },\n    \"review\": {\n      \"weight\": 4,\n      \"classes\": [\"review-aliases\"],\n      \"resources\": [\"deep-review/SKILL.md\"]\n    },\n    \"ai-council\": {\n      \"weight\": 4,\n      \"classes\": [\"ai-council-aliases\"],\n      \"resources\": [\"deep-ai-council/SKILL.md\"]\n    },\n    \"agent-improvement\": {\n      \"weight\": 4,\n      \"classes\": [\"agent-improvement-aliases\"],\n      \"resources\": [\"deep-improvement/SKILL.md\"]\n    },\n    \"model-benchmark\": {\n      \"weight\": 4,\n      \"classes\": [\"model-benchmark-aliases\"],\n      \"resources\": [\"deep-improvement/SKILL.md\"]\n    }\n  },\n  \"vocabularyClasses\": {\n    \"research-aliases\": {\n      \"keywords\": [\"deep-research\", \"deep research\", \"research loop\", \"iterative investigation workflow\", \"research summary\", \"research convergence detection\", \"autoresearch\", \"iterative-research\"]\n    },\n    \"review-aliases\": {\n      \"keywords\": [\"deep-review\", \"deep review\", \"before running deep review\", \"review request\", \"review loop\", \"iterative review loop\", \"severity weighted findings\", \"convergence review\", \"release-readiness\", \"deep-review wave\", \"release readiness\"]\n    },\n    \"ai-council-aliases\": {\n      \"keywords\": [\"deep-ai-council\", \"ai council\", \"ai council deliberation\", \"multi-seat planning council\", \"council convergence\", \"planning council\"]\n    },\n    \"agent-improvement-aliases\": {\n      \"keywords\": [\"improve agent\", \"evaluate agent\", \"agent scoring\", \"agent candidate\", \"score agent candidate\", \"promote or rollback agent change\", \"agent-improvement\", \"deep-improvement\", \"agent improvement\"]\n    },\n    \"model-benchmark-aliases\": {\n      \"keywords\": [\"/deep:model-benchmark\"]\n    },\n    \"hub-identity\": {\n      \"keywords\": [\"system-deep-loop\", \"deep-loop-workflows\", \"deep loop workflows\", \"deep loop workflow\"]\n    }\n  }\n}\n","metadata":{"output":".skilled/commands/deep/assets/legacy/README.md:23:Each body has a matching compiled contract in `../compiled/`. There is no fifth body and no unmatched body-to-contract relationship in this directory. The remaining rollout entries, `deep/agent-improvement` and `deep/model-benchmark`, are intentionally fallback-only command files outside this asset inventory and have not been compiled.\n.skilled/commands/deep/assets/compiled/README.md:23:The compiled inventory is intentionally limited to the three commands registered with the contract compiler and renderer: `deep/ai-council`, `deep/research` and `deep/review`. Each has one matching legacy body in `../legacy/`; no legacy body in that directory lacks a compiled counterpart. The rollout entries for `deep/agent-improvement` and `deep/model-benchmark` are fallback-only and are not compiler-managed asset pairs.\n===LEAF-SCOPES===\n[\n  {\n    \"workflowMode\": \"agent-improvement\",\n    \"leafScopes\": [\n      \"assets/agent-improvement\",\n      \"references/agent-improvement\",\n      \"references/shared\"\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"workflowMode\": \"model-benchmark\",\n    \"leafScopes\": [\n      \"assets/model-benchmark\",\n      \"references/model-benchmark\",\n      \"references/shared\"\n    ]\n  }\n]\n===HUB-ROUTER===\n{\n  \"skill\": \"system-deep-loop\",\n  \"version\": \"1.5.3.0\",\n  \"routerPolicy\": {\n    \"defaultMode\": null,\n    \"ambiguityDelta\": 1,\n    \"tieBreak\": [\"research\", \"review\", \"ai-council\", \"agent-improvement\", \"model-benchmark\"],\n    \"outcomes\": {\n      \"single\": \"one dominant deep-loop intent routes to one mode\",\n      \"orderedBundle\": \"clearly separate deep-loop intents route to an ordered mode list\",\n      \"defer\": \"unclear or contradictory deep-loop intent asks for disambiguation\"\n    },\n    \"defaultResource\": [\"ROUTER.md\", \"mode-registry.json\"],\n    \"defaultResourceSemantics\": \"fallback-only\",\n    \"defaultResourceContract\": \"A scored route assembles exactly the selected mode's declared resources. defaultResource is consulted only when no mode scores (zero-signal branch), and then only as the defer-time suggestion offered with the disambiguation checklist. It is never a stage-two preamble loaded on every route, and never unioned into a scored route's resource set.\",\n    \"launcherVocabularyClasses\": [],\n    \"discoveryClasses\": [\"hub-identity\"],\n    \"discoveryClassesContract\": \"Classes listed here are hub discovery/defer evidence only. They are intentionally referenced by NO mode's scoring classes: a prompt naming only the hub (including its former identity) scores zero modes and takes the defer outcome instead of guessing a loop.\"\n  },\n  \"routerSignals\": {\n    \"research\": {\n      \"weight\": 4,\n      \"classes\": [\"research-aliases\"],\n      \"resources\": [\"deep-research/SKILL.md\"]\n    },\n    \"review\": {\n      \"weight\": 4,\n      \"classes\": [\"review-aliases\"],\n      \"resources\": [\"deep-review/SKILL.md\"]\n    },\n    \"ai-council\": {\n      \"weight\": 4,\n      \"classes\": [\"ai-council-aliases\"],\n      \"resources\": [\"deep-ai-council/SKILL.md\"]\n    },\n    \"agent-improvement\": {\n      \"weight\": 4,\n      \"classes\": [\"agent-improvement-aliases\"],\n      \"resources\": [\"deep-improvement/SKILL.md\"]\n    },\n    \"model-benchmark\": {\n      \"weight\": 4,\n      \"classes\": [\"model-benchmark-aliases\"],\n      \"resources\": [\"deep-improvement/SKILL.md\"]\n    }\n  },\n  \"vocabularyClasses\": {\n    \"research-aliases\": {\n      \"keywords\": [\"deep-research\", \"deep research\", \"research loop\", \"iterative investigation workflow\", \"research summary\", \"research convergence detection\", \"autoresearch\", \"iterative-research\"]\n    },\n    \"review-aliases\": {\n      \"keywords\": [\"deep-review\", \"deep review\", \"before running deep review\", \"review request\", \"review loop\", \"iterative review loop\", \"severity weighted findings\", \"convergence review\", \"release-readiness\", \"deep-review wave\", \"release readiness\"]\n    },\n    \"ai-council-aliases\": {\n      \"keywords\": [\"deep-ai-council\", \"ai council\", \"ai council deliberation\", \"multi-seat planning council\", \"council convergence\", \"planning council\"]\n    },\n    \"agent-improvement-aliases\": {\n      \"keywords\": [\"improve agent\", \"evaluate agent\", \"agent scoring\", \"agent candidate\", \"score agent candidate\", \"promote or rollback agent change\", \"agent-improvement\", \"deep-improvement\", \"agent improvement\"]\n    },\n    \"model-benchmark-aliases\": {\n      \"keywords\": [\"/deep:model-benchmark\"]\n    },\n    \"hub-identity\": {\n      \"keywords\": [\"system-deep-loop\", \"deep-loop-workflows\", \"deep loop workflows\", \"deep loop workflow\"]\n    }\n  }\n}\n","exit":0,"truncated":false},"title":"rg -n \"agent-improvement|deep-improvement\" .skilled/commands/deep/assets/compiled/README.md .skilled/commands/deep/assets/legacy/README.md; echo \"===LEAF-SCOPES===\"; cat .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/leaf-scopes.json; echo \"===HUB-ROUTER===\"; cat .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/hub-router.json","time":{"start":1791657755898,"end":1791657755926}},"id":"prt_1271fc3ec001taH41jXNXHIW1h","sessionID":"ses_ed8e74236ffe5avP2OYno0XijV","messageID":"msg_1271fa806001AeMmUMqsG52y3X"}}
