{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1791657771091,"sessionID":"ses_ed8e74236ffe5avP2OYno0XijV","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"bash","callID":"call_00_fCG94tvCwWCL7BDoTwUX0648","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"rg -n --no-config -S \"agent-improvement|deep-improvement|deep:agent\" .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/README.md .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/ARCHITECTURE.md .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/package.json .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/description.json 2>/dev/null | head -60; echo \"===DIRS===\"; rg -ln --no-config -S \"agent-improvement|deep-improvement\" .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/benchmark .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/changelog .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/feature-catalog .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/manual-testing-playbook .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/shared 2>/dev/null | head -40"},"output":".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/description.json:3:  \"description\": \"Unified deep-loop parent hub: the single advisor-routable home for active deep-loop personas, routing to five modes across four workflow families over a nested runtime/ infrastructure layer (formerly the separate deep-loop-runtime skill, merged 2026-07-08). research (outward web+code iterative investigation \\u2192 research/ artifacts), review (iterative review loop \\u2192 P0/P1/P2 findings + verdict), ai-council (multi-seat planning deliberation \\u2192 ai-council/ artifacts), and two improvement lanes on the deep-improvement packet (agent-improvement, model-benchmark). The hub holds no per-mode convergence, state, or synthesis logic; each mode keeps its own contract in its packet and is reachable via its /deep:* command and native agent.\",\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/description.json:13:    \"deep-improvement\",\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/description.json:24:    \"agent-improvement\",\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/README.md:61:- **`workflowMode`** is the public key used by commands, the advisor and the registry, for example `research`, `ai-council` or `agent-improvement`.\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/README.md:82:| `deep-research/`, `deep-review/`, `deep-ai-council/`, `deep-improvement/` | The active mode packets, each with its own `SKILL.md`, references, scripts, assets and governance. |\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/README.md:87:Active `/deep:*` commands and deep agents (`deep-research`, `deep-review`, `deep-improvement` and `ai-council`) dispatch into the matching mode packet. `@context` remains the one-shot retrieval agent.\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/README.md:114:Adding another active mode (a new packet beyond `deep-research`, `deep-review`, `deep-ai-council`, `deep-improvement`) touches every one of these surfaces: miss one and the mode is either unroutable, undiscoverable, or drift-guard-broken:\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/ARCHITECTURE.md:25:- The mode packets `deep-research/`, `deep-review/`, `deep-ai-council/` and `deep-improvement/` carry each mode's contract, references, assets and mode-local scripts. `shared/` carries helpers the packets share.\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/ARCHITECTURE.md:71:├── deep-improvement/            # Agent-improvement and model-benchmark lanes\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/ARCHITECTURE.md:115:**Per-mode ledgers.** Each mode has a ledger schema, reducers and sealed artifacts (`deep-research-*`, `deep-review-*`, `deep-ai-council-*`, `agent-improvement-*`, `model-benchmark-*`, `deep-improvement-common-*`). Reducers derive projections from the append-only ledger, and `per-mode-authority-flip/` records when a mode's authority has moved to that ledger.\n===DIRS===\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/manual-testing-playbook/improvement-lane-routing/model-benchmark.md\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/shared/behavior-benchmark/framework.md\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/shared/rollout/command-injection-rollout.json\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/manual-testing-playbook/improvement-lane-routing/agent-improvement.md\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/feature-catalog/deep-loop-mode-classification/deep-loop-mode-classification.md\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/shared/behavior-benchmark/README.md\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/changelog/v1.5.0.0.md\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/shared/progress/README.md\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/feature-catalog/feature-catalog.md\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/manual-testing-playbook/manual-testing-playbook.md\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/manual-testing-playbook/advisor-integration/lexical-mode-scoring.md\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/manual-testing-playbook/runtime-and-backend/external-adapter.md\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/manual-testing-playbook/advisor-integration/single-advisor-identity.md\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/changelog/v1.0.0.0.md\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/manual-testing-playbook/runtime-and-backend/improvement-host.md\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/manual-testing-playbook/advisor-integration/command-bridge-guard.md\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/manual-testing-playbook/advisor-integration/no-false-fire-code-edit.md\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/changelog/v1.2.0.0.md\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/changelog/v1.5.3.0.md\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/benchmark/README.md\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/benchmark/reports/compiled-routing/2026-07-21--real--luna-high/skill-benchmark-report.json\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/benchmark/reports/baseline/skill-benchmark-report.json\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/benchmark/reports/baseline/skill-benchmark-report.md\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/benchmark/reports/compiled-routing/2026-07-21--playbook-verify--sonnet/report.json\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/benchmark/reports/compiled-routing/2026-07-21--playbook-verify--sonnet/report.md\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/benchmark/reports/compiled-routing/2026-07-21--verify--luna-high/skill-benchmark-report.json\n","metadata":{"output":".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/description.json:3:  \"description\": \"Unified deep-loop parent hub: the single advisor-routable home for active deep-loop personas, routing to five modes across four workflow families over a nested runtime/ infrastructure layer (formerly the separate deep-loop-runtime skill, merged 2026-07-08). research (outward web+code iterative investigation \\u2192 research/ artifacts), review (iterative review loop \\u2192 P0/P1/P2 findings + verdict), ai-council (multi-seat planning deliberation \\u2192 ai-council/ artifacts), and two improvement lanes on the deep-improvement packet (agent-improvement, model-benchmark). The hub holds no per-mode convergence, state, or synthesis logic; each mode keeps its own contract in its packet and is reachable via its /deep:* command and native agent.\",\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/description.json:13:    \"deep-improvement\",\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/description.json:24:    \"agent-improvement\",\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/README.md:61:- **`workflowMode`** is the public key used by commands, the advisor and the registry, for example `research`, `ai-council` or `agent-improvement`.\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/README.md:82:| `deep-research/`, `deep-review/`, `deep-ai-council/`, `deep-improvement/` | The active mode packets, each with its own `SKILL.md`, references, scripts, assets and governance. |\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/README.md:87:Active `/deep:*` commands and deep agents (`deep-research`, `deep-review`, `deep-improvement` and `ai-council`) dispatch into the matching mode packet. `@context` remains the one-shot retrieval agent.\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/README.md:114:Adding another active mode (a new packet beyond `deep-research`, `deep-review`, `deep-ai-council`, `deep-improvement`) touches every one of these surfaces: miss one and the mode is either unroutable, undiscoverable, or drift-guard-broken:\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/ARCHITECTURE.md:25:- The mode packets `deep-research/`, `deep-review/`, `deep-ai-council/` and `deep-improvement/` carry each mode's contract, references, assets and mode-local scripts. `shared/` carries helpers the packets share.\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/ARCHITECTURE.md:71:├── deep-improvement/            # Agent-improvement and model-benchmark lanes\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/ARCHITECTURE.md:115:**Per-mode ledgers.** Each mode has a ledger schema, reducers and sealed artifacts (`deep-research-*`, `deep-review-*`, `deep-ai-council-*`, `agent-improvement-*`, `model-benchmark-*`, `deep-improvement-common-*`). Reducers derive projections from the append-only ledger, and `per-mode-authority-flip/` records when a mode's authority has moved to that ledger.\n===DIRS===\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/manual-testing-playbook/improvement-lane-routing/model-benchmark.md\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/shared/behavior-benchmark/framework.md\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/shared/rollout/command-injection-rollout.json\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/manual-testing-playbook/improvement-lane-routing/agent-improvement.md\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/feature-catalog/deep-loop-mode-classification/deep-loop-mode-classification.md\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/shared/behavior-benchmark/README.md\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/changelog/v1.5.0.0.md\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/shared/progress/README.md\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/feature-catalog/feature-catalog.md\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/manual-testing-playbook/manual-testing-playbook.md\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/manual-testing-playbook/advisor-integration/lexical-mode-scoring.md\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/manual-testing-playbook/runtime-and-backend/external-adapter.md\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/manual-testing-playbook/advisor-integration/single-advisor-identity.md\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/changelog/v1.0.0.0.md\n.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/manual-testing-playbook/runtime-and-backend/improvement-host.md\n.skilled/sk