{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1791658072552,"sessionID":"ses_ed8e74236ffe5avP2OYno0XijV","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"bash","callID":"call_00_lI5LnE4dbRrnlZGyaHa48658","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"cd .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime\nhead -30 lib/agent-improvement-ledger-schema/README.md; echo \"======\"; head -20 lib/agent-improvement-reducers/README.md; echo \"======\"; head -20 lib/agent-improvement-sealed-artifacts/README.md; echo \"===JS FILES===\"; find lib/agent-improvement-ledger-schema lib/agent-improvement-reducers lib/agent-improvement-sealed-artifacts -name \"*.js\" | head; echo \"===AUTH FLIP===\"; sed -n '15,30p;125,145p' lib/per-mode-authority-flip/types.ts; echo \"===TESTS LIST===\"; ls tests/unit/ | rg -i \"improvement\" "},"output":"---\ntitle: \"agent-improvement-ledger-schema: Ledger Schema\"\ndescription: \"Agent Improvement ledger schema layer for the durable runtime event spine.\"\ntrigger_phrases:\n  - \"agent-improvement-ledger-schema\"\n  - \"agent-improvement ledger schema\"\n---\n\n# Agent Improvement Ledger Schema\n\n---\n\n## 1. OVERVIEW\n\nThis folder defines the lane's durable event stems, payloads and compatibility types for the Agent Improvement runtime lane. It keeps lane-specific contracts beside the shared ledger, event-envelope and replay primitives, then publishes the supported surface through the public barrel.\n\nThe module is documentation-only at this boundary. Callers should use the exported API in `index.ts` and leave filesystem, ledger and migration ownership to the shared runtime services.\n\n---\n\n## 2. FILES\n\n| File | Responsibility |\n|---|---|\n| `agent-improvement-ledger-schema.ts` | event definitions, payload construction and schema validation |\n| `agent-improvement-ledger-types.ts` | Lane-specific types, constants and contract values. |\n| `index.ts` | Public barrel for the lane-specific API and types. |\n\n---\n\n======\n---\ntitle: \"agent-improvement-reducers: Reducers\"\ndescription: \"Agent Improvement reducers layer for the durable runtime event spine.\"\ntrigger_phrases:\n  - \"agent-improvement-reducers\"\n  - \"agent-improvement reducers\"\n---\n\n# Agent Improvement Reducers\n\n---\n\n## 1. OVERVIEW\n\nThis folder folds verified lane events into immutable projection state for the Agent Improvement runtime lane. It keeps lane-specific contracts beside the shared ledger, event-envelope and replay primitives, then publishes the supported surface through the public barrel.\n\nThe module is documentation-only at this boundary. Callers should use the exported API in `index.ts` and leave filesystem, ledger and migration ownership to the shared runtime services.\n\n---\n\n======\n---\ntitle: \"agent-improvement-sealed-artifacts: Sealed Artifacts\"\ndescription: \"Agent Improvement sealed artifacts layer for the durable runtime event spine.\"\ntrigger_phrases:\n  - \"agent-improvement-sealed-artifacts\"\n  - \"agent-improvement sealed artifacts\"\n---\n\n# Agent Improvement Sealed Artifacts\n\n---\n\n## 1. OVERVIEW\n\nThis folder canonicalizes, seals and reads lane-owned evidence artifacts for the Agent Improvement runtime lane. It keeps lane-specific contracts beside the shared ledger, event-envelope and replay primitives, then publishes the supported surface through the public barrel.\n\nThe module is documentation-only at this boundary. Callers should use the exported API in `index.ts` and leave filesystem, ledger and migration ownership to the shared runtime services.\n\n---\n\n===JS FILES===\n===AUTH FLIP===\n// ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n\nexport const AUTHORITY_FLIP_SCHEMA_VERSION = 1;\nexport const AUTHORITY_FLIP_EVENT_TYPE = 'deep-loop-authority-flip.ledger.transition-recorded';\n\nexport type CutoverCertificateMode =\n  | 'agent-improvement'\n  | 'deep-ai-council'\n  | 'deep-improvement-common'\n  | 'deep-research'\n  | 'deep-review'\n  | 'model-benchmark';\n\n/** Route a selector may hand a mode adapter; there is never more than one canonical route. */\nexport type AuthorityRoute = 'legacy' | 'dark';\n\n// 4. MANIFEST ORDER\n// ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n\n/** The mode/workstream identities in the frozen cutover-order sequence. */\nexport const AUTHORITY_FLIP_MODE_ORDER: readonly CutoverCertificateMode[] = Object.freeze([\n  'deep-research',\n  'deep-review',\n  'deep-ai-council',\n  'deep-improvement-common',\n  'agent-improvement',\n  'model-benchmark',\n]);\n===TESTS LIST===\nagent-improvement-ledger-schema.vitest.ts\nagent-improvement-reducers.vitest.ts\nagent-improvement-sealed-artifacts.vitest.ts\ndeep-improvement-common-ledger-schema.vitest.ts\ndeep-improvement-common-reducers.vitest.ts\ndeep-improvement-common-sealed-artifacts.vitest.ts\ndeep-improvement-ledgers-contract.vitest.ts\nhost-driven-improvement.vitest.ts\n","metadata":{"output":"---\ntitle: \"agent-improvement-ledger-schema: Ledger Schema\"\ndescription: \"Agent Improvement ledger schema layer for the durable runtime event spine.\"\ntrigger_phrases:\n  - \"agent-improvement-ledger-schema\"\n  - \"agent-improvement ledger schema\"\n---\n\n# Agent Improvement Ledger Schema\n\n---\n\n## 1. OVERVIEW\n\nThis folder defines the lane's durable event stems, payloads and compatibility types for the Agent Improvement runtime lane. It keeps lane-specific contracts beside the shared ledger, event-envelope and replay primitives, then publishes the supported surface through the public barrel.\n\nThe module is documentation-only at this boundary. Callers should use the exported API in `index.ts` and leave filesystem, ledger and migration ownership to the shared runtime services.\n\n---\n\n## 2. FILES\n\n| File | Responsibility |\n|---|---|\n| `agent-improvement-ledger-schema.ts` | event definitions, payload construction and schema validation |\n| `agent-improvement-ledger-types.ts` | Lane-specific types, constants and contract values. |\n| `index.ts` | Public barrel for the lane-specific API and types. |\n\n---\n\n======\n---\ntitle: \"agent-improvement-reducers: Reducers\"\ndescription: \"Agent Improvement reducers layer for the durable runtime event spine.\"\ntrigger_phrases:\n  - \"agent-improvement-reducers\"\n  - \"agent-improvement reducers\"\n---\n\n# Agent Improvement Reducers\n\n---\n\n## 1. OVERVIEW\n\nThis folder folds verified lane events into immutable projection state for the Agent Improvement runtime lane. It keeps lane-specific contracts beside the shared ledger, event-envelope and replay primitives, then publishes the supported surface through the public barrel.\n\nThe module is documentation-only at this boundary. Callers should use the exported API in `index.ts` and leave filesystem, ledger and migration ownership to the shared runtime services.\n\n---\n\n======\n---\ntitle: \"agent-improvement-sealed-artifacts: Sealed Artifacts\"\ndescription: \"Agent Improvement sealed artifacts layer for the durable runtime event spine.\"\ntrigger_phrases:\n  - \"agent-improvement-sealed-artifacts\"\n  - \"agent-improvement sealed artifacts\"\n---\n\n# Agent Improvement Sealed Artifacts\n\n---\n\n## 1. OVERVIEW\n\nThis folder canonicalizes, seals and reads lane-owned evidence artifacts for the Agent Improvement runtime lane. It keeps lane-specific contracts beside the shared ledger, event-envelope and replay primitives, then publishes the supported surface through the public barrel.\n\nThe module is documentation-only at this boundary. Callers should use the exported API in `index.ts` and leave filesystem, ledger and migration ownership to the shared runtime services.\n\n---\n\n===JS FILES===\n===AUTH FLIP===\n// ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n\nexport const AUTHORITY_FLIP_SCHEMA_VERSION = 1;\nexport const AUTHORITY_FLIP_EVENT_TYPE = 'deep-loop-authority-flip.ledger.transition-recorded';\n\nexport type CutoverCertificateMode =\n  | 'agent-improvement'\n  | 'deep-ai-council'\n  | 'deep-improvement-common'\n  | 'deep-research'\n  | 'deep-review'\n  | 'model-benchmark';\n\n/** Route a selector may hand a mode adapter; there is never more than one canonical route. */\nexport type AuthorityRoute = 'legacy' | 'dark';\n\n// 4. MANIFEST ORDER\n// ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n\n/** The mode/workstream identities in the frozen cutover-order sequence. */\nexport const AUTHORITY_FLIP_MODE_ORDER: readonly CutoverCertificateMode[] = Object.freeze([\n  'deep-research',\n  'deep-review',\n  'deep-ai-council',\n  'deep-improvement-common',\n  'agent-improvement',\n  'model-benchmark',\n]);\n===TESTS LIST===\nagent-improvement-ledger-schema.vitest.ts\nagent-improvement-reducers.vitest.ts\nagent-improvement-sealed-artifacts.vitest.ts\ndeep-improvement-common-ledger-schema.vitest.ts\ndeep-improvement-common-reducers.vitest.ts\ndeep-improvement-common-sealed-artifacts.vitest.ts\ndeep-improvement-ledgers-contract.vitest.ts\nhost-driven-improvement.vitest.ts\n","exit":0,"truncated":false},"title":"cd .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime\nhead -30 lib/agent-improvement-ledger-schema/README.md; echo \"======\"; head -20 lib/agent-improvement-reducers/README.md; echo \"======\"; head -20 lib/agent-improvement-sealed-artifacts/README.md; echo \"===JS FILES===\"; find lib/agent-improvement-ledger-schema lib/agent-improvement-reducers lib/agent-improvement-sealed-artifacts -name \"*.js\" | head; echo \"===AUTH FLIP===\"; sed -n '15,30p;125,145p' lib/per-mode-authority-flip/types.ts; echo \"===TESTS LIST===\"; ls tests/unit/ | rg -i \"improvement\" ","time":{"start":1791658072502,"end":1791658072550}},"id":"prt_1272497a7001Ey2IdyDhFY8WGO","sessionID":"ses_ed8e74236ffe5avP2OYno0XijV","messageID":"msg_127247ec9001RjIBbuAwIF9K1U"}}
