{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1791658384810,"sessionID":"ses_ed8e74236ffe5avP2OYno0XijV","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"bash","callID":"call_00_xixLFHf7HN8xqVXx2EoI4710","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"rg -n \"agent-improvement|deep-improvement\" .skilled/skills/sk-code/benchmark/reports/compiled-routing/2026-07-21--real--luna-high/skill-benchmark-report.json .skilled/skills/cli-external-orchestration/cli-opencode/changelog/v1.1.0.0.md .skilled/changelog/skilled/v4.0.0.0.md .skilled/changelog/skilled/v3+/v3.5.0.0.md 2>/dev/null | head -12; echo \"===TIMESTAMP===\"; date -u +%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%SZ"},"output":"...output truncated...\n\nFull output saved to: /Users/michelkerkmeester/.local/share/opencode/tool-output/tool_127295d99001wGnIGfzfjCyLc2\n\n===TIMESTAMP===\n2026-10-10T18:53:04Z\n","metadata":{"output":"...\n\nencode/`, keep the surface as OPENCODE and load Motion only as reference material.\\\\n.opencode/skills/sk-code/shared/references/smart-routing.md:96:- **MOTION_DEV** intent scoring favors Motion API, timeline, scroll/gesture, performance, import-mode, snippet, and decision_matrix terms; it supplements the detected surface rather than replacing it.\\\\n.opencode/skills/sk-code/shared/references/smart-routing.md:120:| IMPLEMENTATION | MUST load the implementation trio: `code-webflow/references/implementation/animation-workflows/overview-decision-tree-and-css.md`, `code-webflow/references/implementation/implementation-workflows/condition-based-waiting.md`, `code-webflow/references/implementation/performance-patterns/overview-and-checklist.md`; then add per-language style guides (`code-webflow/references/javascript/style-guide/overview-naming-and-structure.md`, `code-webflow/references/css/style-guide.md`) and focused guides such as forms/vendor refs as needed |\\\\n.opencode/skills/sk-code/shared/references/smart-routing.md:150:## 5. MOTION_DEV MAP\\\\n.opencode/skills/sk-code/shared/references/smart-routing.md:152:MOTION_DEV loads from `code-webflow/references/animation/` and `code-webflow/assets/animation/` as a peer resource category. It is not a separate code surface; it supplements WEBFLOW, OPENCODE, or future surfaces when the request needs Motion API, integration, or decision guidance.\\\\n.opencode/skills/sk-code/shared/references/smart-routing.md:154:Webflow implementation and verification resources remain owned by their corresponding WEBFLOW intents; MOTION_DEV owns only the animation peer resources below.\\\\n.opencode/skills/sk-code/shared/references/smart-routing.md:158:| ANIMATION / MOTION_DEV | `code-webflow/references/animation/quick-start.md`, `code-webflow/references/animation/animation-principles.md`, `code-webflow/references/animation/animate-and-timelines.md`, `code-webflow/references/animation/scroll-and-gestures.md`, `code-webflow/assets/animation/snippets/principled-reveal.js` |\\\\n.opencode/skills/sk-code/shared/references/smart-routing.md:160:| IMPLEMENTATION / API | `code-webflow/references/animation/integration-patterns.md`, exact snippet assets such as `code-webflow/assets/animation/snippets/animate-on-scroll.js` and `code-webflow/assets/animation/snippets/in-view-reveal.js` |\\\\n.opencode/skills/sk-code/shared/references/smart-routing.md:164:When WEBFLOW and MOTION_DEV both match, load Webflow guidance for CDN, `window.Motion`, Designer, and browser verification constraints, then load the animation overlay (`code-webflow/references/animation/`) for cross-stack Motion details.\\\\n.opencode/skills/sk-code/shared/references/smart-routing.md:166:When explicit non-Webflow language and MOTION_DEV both match, do not load `code-webflow/references/*` or `code-webflow/assets/*`. Load Motion.dev peer resources by exact path while keeping the surface UNKNOWN or N/A:\\\\n.opencode/skills/sk-code/shared/references/smart-routing.md:201:IMPLEMENTATION loads the shared organization and naming baseline:\\\\n.opencode/skills/sk-code/shared/references/smart-routing.md:234:| New agent | `code-opencode/assets/checklists/agent-authoring.md` |\\\\n.opencode/skills/sk-code/shared/references/smart-routing.md:260:Do not load Go/NextJS/React Native resources from canonical sk-code; those surfaces live in the Barter sk-code fork (`barter/.opencode/skills/sk-code/references/`). Canonical sk-code only owns WEBFLOW + OPENCODE + MOTION_DEV.\\\\n.opencode/skills/sk-code/shared/references/smart-routing.md:286:- Treat MOTION_DEV as a surface (it's a peer resource category)\\\\n.opencode/skills/sk-code/shared/references/smart-routing.md:325:    \\\\\\\"IMPLEMENTATION\\\\\\\":     {\\\\\\\"weight\\\\\\\": 1, \\\\\\\"keywords\\\\\\\": [\\\\\\\"implement\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"build\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"create\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"feature\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"component\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"module\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"authoring\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"smooth-scroll\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"intersectionobserver\\\\\\\"]},\\\\n.opencode/skills/sk-code/shared/references/smart-routing.md:332:    \\\\\\\"ANIMATION\\\\\\\":          {\\\\\\\"weight\\\\\\\": 1, \\\\\\\"keywords\\\\\\\": [\\\\\\\"animation\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"transition\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"easing\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"stagger\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"motion principles\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"motion language\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"gsap\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"lenis\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"carousel\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"parallax\\\\\\\"]},\\\\n.opencode/skills/sk-code/shared/references/smart-routing.md:333:    \\\\\\\"MOTION_DEV\\\\\\\":         {\\\\\\\"weight\\\\\\\": 1, \\\\\\\"keywords\\\\\\\": [\\\\\\\"motion.dev\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"motion-dev\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"motion api\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"motion demo\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"animate()\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"inview\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"in-view\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"motion cdn\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"scroll()\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"stagger()\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"animation principles\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"cross-stack animation\\\\\\\"]},\\\\n.opencode/skills/sk-code/shared/references/smart-routing.md:348:    \\\\\\\"IMPLEMENTATION\\\\\\\": [\\\\n.opencode/skills/sk-code/shared/references/smart-routing.md:349:        \\\\\\\"references/universal/multi-agent-research.md\\\\\\\",\\\\n.opencode/skills/sk-code/shared/references/smart-routing.md:374:        \\\\\\\"code-opencode/assets/checklists/agent-authoring.md\\\\\\\",\\\\n.opencode/skills/sk-code/shared/references/smart-routing.md:405:        \\\\\\\"code-webflow/references/debugging/debugging-workflows/sub-agent-verification.md\\\\\\\",\\\\n.opencode/skills/sk-code/shared/references/smart-routing.md:442:    \\\\\\\"ANIMATION\\\\\\\": [\\\\n.opencode/skills/sk-code/shared/references/smart-routing.md:451:    \\\\\\\"MOTION_DEV\\\\\\\": [\\\\n.opencode/skills/sk-code/shared/references/smart-routing.md:574:- the Motion.dev overlay (`code-webflow/references/animation/*`) when a `MOTION_DEV` intent fires.\\\\n\\\\nexec\\\\n/bin/zsh -lc \\\\\\\"rg -n -F \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"As a visitor scrolls my marketing landing page\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" .opencode/skills/sk-code || true; rg -n -F '\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"agent\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"' .opencode/skills/sk-code/code-webflow .opencode/skills/sk-code/shared | head -80\\\\\\\" in /Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.worktrees/0089-sk-doc-default-routing-cutover\\\\n succeeded in 0ms:\\\\ncodex\\\\nRouting resolves to the Webflow surface: GSAP is an explicit Webflow marker, while `IntersectionObserver` and animation terms select implementation plus animation intent resources. No agent dispatch is warranted for this read-only routing result.\\\\nexec\\\\n/bin/zsh -lc \\\\\\\"sed -n '60,180p' .opencode/skills/sk-code/code-webflow/SKILL.md; sed -n '110,180p' .opencode/skills/sk-code/shared/references/smart-routing.md\\\\\\\" in /Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.worktrees/0089-sk-doc-default-routing-cutover\\\\n succeeded in 0ms:\\\\n# (re-prefixed with code-webflow/) and the sibling code-opencode map plus the\\\\n# parent-owned universal/shared tier; a drift guard enforces that equality.\\\\nDEFAULT_RESOURCE = [\\\\n    \\\\\\\"references/shared/dev-workflow/overview-nav-and-logging.md\\\\\\\",\\\\n    \\\\\\\"references/shared/dev-workflow/automation-errors-and-compat.md\\\\\\\",\\\\n    \\\\\\\"references/shared/dev-workflow/common-commands.md\\\\\\\",\\\\n    \\\\\\\"references/shared/dev-workflow/checklists-and-decision-matrix.md\\\\\\\",\\\\n]\\\\n\\\\nINTENT_SIGNALS = {\\\\n    \\\\\\\"IMPLEMENTATION\\\\\\\":     {\\\\\\\"weight\\\\\\\": 1, \\\\\\\"keywords\\\\\\\": [\\\\\\\"implement\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"build\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"create\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"feature\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"component\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"module\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"authoring\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"smooth-scroll\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"intersectionobserver\\\\\\\"]},\\\\n    \\\\\\\"CODE_QUALITY\\\\\\\":       {\\\\\\\"weight\\\\\\\": 1, \\\\\\\"keywords\\\\\\\": [\\\\\\\"lint\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"format\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"quality gate\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"naming\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"standards\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"code smell\\\\\\\"]},\\\\n    \\\\\\\"DEBUGGING\\\\\\\":          {\\\\\\\"weight\\\\\\\": 1, \\\\\\\"keywords\\\\\\\": [\\\\\\\"debug\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"broken\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"failing\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"stack trace\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"console error\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"regression\\\\\\\"]},\\\\n    \\\\\\\"VERIFICATION\\\\\\\":       {\\\\\\\"weight\\\\\\\": 1, \\\\\\\"keywords\\\\\\\": [\\\\\\\"verify\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"passing\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"type-check\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"alignment drift\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"completion claim\\\\\\\"]},\\\\n    \\\\\\\"TESTING\\\\\\\":            {\\\\\\\"weight\\\\\\\": 1, \\\\\\\"keywords\\\\\\\": [\\\\\\\"unit test\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"integration test\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"coverage\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"vitest\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"pytest\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"shellcheck\\\\\\\"]},\\\\n    \\\\\\\"DEPLOYMENT\\\\\\\":         {\\\\\\\"weight\\\\\\\": 1, \\\\\\\"keywords\\\\\\\": [\\\\\\\"deploy\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"cdn\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"wrangler\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"minify\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"staging\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"production release\\\\\\\"]},\\\\n    \\\\\\\"PERFORMANCE\\\\\\\":        {\\\\\\\"weight\\\\\\\": 1, \\\\\\\"keywords\\\\\\\": [\\\\\\\"lighthouse\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"core web vitals\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"web vitals\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"largest contentful\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"lcp\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"interaction to next paint\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"inp\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"cumulative layout shift\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"cls\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"pagespeed\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"jank\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"frame budget\\\\\\\"]},\\\\n    \\\\\\\"ANIMATION\\\\\\\":          {\\\\\\\"weight\\\\\\\": 1, \\\\\\\"keywords\\\\\\\": [\\\\\\\"animation\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"transition\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"easing\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"stagger\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"motion principles\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"motion language\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"gsap\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"lenis\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"carousel\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"parallax\\\\\\\"]},\\\\n    \\\\\\\"MOTION_DEV\\\\\\\":         {\\\\\\\"weight\\\\\\\": 1, \\\\\\\"keywords\\\\\\\": [\\\\\\\"motion.dev\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"motion-dev\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"animate()\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"inview\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"in-view\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"motion cdn\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"scroll()\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"stagger()\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"animation principles\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"cross-stack animation\\\\\\\"]},\\\\n    \\\\\\\"ACCESSIBILITY\\\\\\\":      {\\\\\\\"weight\\\\\\\": 1, \\\\\\\"keywords\\\\\\\": [\\\\\\\"reduced motion\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"reduced-motion\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"prefers-reduced-motion\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"a11y\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"accessibility\\\\\\\"]},\\\\n    \\\\\\\"FORMS\\\\\\\":              {\\\\\\\"weight\\\\\\\": 1, \\\\\\\"keywords\\\\\\\": [\\\\\\\"form upload\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"filepond\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"field validation\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"focus trap\\\\\\\"]},\\\\n    \\\\\\\"VIDEO\\\\\\\":              {\\\\\\\"weight\\\\\\\": 1, \\\\\\\"keywords\\\\\\\": [\\\\\\\"hls\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"adaptive stream\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"video player\\\\\\\"]},\\\\n    \\\\\\\"LANGUAGE_STANDARDS\\\\\\\": {\\\\\\\"weight\\\\\\\": 1, \\\\\\\"keywords\\\\\\\": [\\\\\\\"typescript\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\".ts\\\\\\\", \\